1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,300
Me, Kori, Melissa,

2
00:00:02,520 --> 00:00:09,520
Brook

3
00:00:37,660 --> 00:00:40,460
Let's go.

4
00:01:21,140 --> 00:01:22,760
I don't know.

5
00:01:43,620 --> 00:01:49,600
And, the enemy of the planet, Koromon,
was killed by the enemy of Koromon.

6
00:01:52,320 --> 00:01:54,520
But, Koromon was the Skull Koromon.

7
00:02:05,080 --> 00:02:08,060
The enemy was the Metal Koromon.

8
00:02:10,580 --> 00:02:12,780
Hold on, Agumon. I'll be there soon.

9
00:02:15,540 --> 00:02:16,952
Just a few more minutes.

10
00:02:18,300 --> 00:02:20,320
Oh, integrate, quadratic?

11
00:02:20,720 --> 00:02:23,480
It's like this stuff
makes no sense. Hurry!

12
00:02:23,780 --> 00:02:24,680
We're late!

13
00:02:24,920 --> 00:02:25,860
Quit splashing!

14
00:02:30,460 --> 00:02:31,640
You guys are late.

15
00:02:31,780 --> 00:02:32,960
We're so sorry, Tai.

16
00:02:33,500 --> 00:02:34,860
Hey, don't blame Kari.

17
00:02:35,040 --> 00:02:35,957
It's my fault we're late.

18
00:02:36,040 --> 00:02:37,497
I had an appointment for a haircut,

19
00:02:37,580 --> 00:02:40,557
but when I looked in the mirror,
I realized my hair was perfect.

20
00:02:40,640 --> 00:02:43,657
The problem is, he was looking
in the mirror for over an hour.

21
00:02:43,740 --> 00:02:45,100
But what about Agumon?

22
00:02:45,340 --> 00:02:47,340
Have him make his own appointment.

23
00:02:47,900 --> 00:02:50,057
Davis, if you're going to be
a member of the Digidestined,

24
00:02:50,140 --> 00:02:52,297
you're going to have to think less
of your hair and more of the team.

25
00:02:52,380 --> 00:02:53,210
Okay.

26
00:02:53,293 --> 00:02:55,020
Now let's go and save Agumon.

27
00:02:56,080 --> 00:02:57,240
But where is Yoli?

28
00:02:59,480 --> 00:03:00,897
She's cleaning her glasses.

29
00:03:00,980 --> 00:03:03,377
As big as her glasses are,
that could take hours.

30
00:03:03,460 --> 00:03:05,057
When are people going to
learn to wear goggles?

31
00:03:05,140 --> 00:03:08,117
We'll hurry up and go find
her so we can leave already.

32
00:03:08,200 --> 00:03:09,030
Okay, okay.

33
00:03:09,400 --> 00:03:10,260
I'll go, too.

34
00:03:11,420 --> 00:03:12,250
Yoli!

35
00:03:12,333 --> 00:03:13,238
Hey, how you doing?

36
00:03:14,520 --> 00:03:17,217
Yoli, we've been waiting for
you to go to the digital world.

37
00:03:17,300 --> 00:03:18,888
We're going to save Agumon.

38
00:03:18,980 --> 00:03:21,720
And show that digital
emperor just who's boss.

39
00:03:21,980 --> 00:03:23,160
Whoa, what's wrong?

40
00:03:23,480 --> 00:03:25,477
Aren't you excited to
go to the digital world?

41
00:03:25,560 --> 00:03:27,060
I'm not going. Why not?

42
00:03:27,180 --> 00:03:28,857
Tell us what's wrong so we can help.

43
00:03:28,940 --> 00:03:29,770
Well,

44
00:03:29,853 --> 00:03:30,957
I can see you're the
last person I would ever

45
00:03:31,040 --> 00:03:33,317
turn to if I was in trouble
and needed some help.

46
00:03:33,400 --> 00:03:35,160
Be nice, Tai. I'm sorry.

47
00:03:35,340 --> 00:03:36,737
I'm just worried about Agumon.

48
00:03:36,820 --> 00:03:38,717
I don't want any of you
to put yourself in danger

49
00:03:38,800 --> 00:03:40,437
if you feel like you're
not up to the challenge,

50
00:03:40,520 --> 00:03:43,037
so maybe it would be best
if you stayed here, Yoli.

51
00:03:43,120 --> 00:03:46,317
I don't want anyone going if
their heart's not into it.

52
00:03:46,400 --> 00:03:48,397
And if it'll make you
feel any better, Yoli,

53
00:03:48,480 --> 00:03:51,617
you can stay and do my math
homework just to keep yourself busy.

54
00:03:51,700 --> 00:03:52,530
Mine, too.

55
00:03:52,680 --> 00:03:56,177
Now that I think about it, my kendo
sticks could use some polishing.

56
00:03:56,260 --> 00:03:57,857
It's all right if I don't go?

57
00:03:57,940 --> 00:03:59,697
Sure, you can make a day of it.

58
00:03:59,780 --> 00:04:03,604
Cleaning, math homework, and all
those other fun things you love.

59
00:04:04,420 --> 00:04:05,250
You sure?

60
00:04:05,333 --> 00:04:06,297
What do I have to do?

61
00:04:06,380 --> 00:04:07,237
Hold up a sign?

62
00:04:07,320 --> 00:04:09,737
If everyone says you should
stay, then you should stay.

63
00:04:09,820 --> 00:04:11,157
That someone's right, Yuli.

64
00:04:11,240 --> 00:04:12,070
Huh?

65
00:04:12,153 --> 00:04:14,277
If you don't feel like
going to the digital world,

66
00:04:14,360 --> 00:04:16,357
then I don't feel like going either.

67
00:04:16,440 --> 00:04:19,377
Now that that's finally
settled, let's go get Agumon.

68
00:04:19,460 --> 00:04:20,290
Right.

69
00:04:21,300 --> 00:04:24,940
If everyone's ready, let's go,
Digidestined Digi-port open!

70
00:04:35,680 --> 00:04:38,140
The Dark Rings keep failing me.

71
00:04:38,560 --> 00:04:40,220
First there was Andromon.

72
00:04:43,580 --> 00:04:45,300
And then Skulgring.

73
00:04:55,280 --> 00:04:56,680
The Dark Ring.

74
00:04:57,200 --> 00:05:00,376
There must be a flaw with
it, but what could be wrong?

75
00:05:00,980 --> 00:05:02,977
Is it just not powerful enough?

76
00:05:03,060 --> 00:05:05,440
Ooh, I can still experiment on Greymon.

77
00:05:05,700 --> 00:05:06,780
Here we go again.

78
00:05:08,540 --> 00:05:10,797
It's good to have the
whole gang back again.

79
00:05:10,880 --> 00:05:12,077
Welcome to my treehouse.

80
00:05:12,160 --> 00:05:15,717
Actually, it's not much of a treehouse
anymore since SkullGreymon disintegrated it.

81
00:05:15,800 --> 00:05:17,137
Now it's more of a twig house.

82
00:05:17,220 --> 00:05:18,050
That's okay.

83
00:05:18,133 --> 00:05:19,957
I was planning on redecorating anyway.

84
00:05:20,040 --> 00:05:22,697
We don't care about your
stupid tree, Tentomon.

85
00:05:22,780 --> 00:05:25,977
We're here to stop the Digital
Emperor from hurting more Digimon.

86
00:05:26,060 --> 00:05:28,197
It's incredibly important we stop him.

87
00:05:28,280 --> 00:05:33,045
If he continues to gain power like this,
he'll threaten the entire digital world.

88
00:05:33,220 --> 00:05:35,120
Hey, watch it, Cody. Be careful.

89
00:05:35,680 --> 00:05:38,480
I'm sorry, but that can makes me so angry.

90
00:05:38,800 --> 00:05:39,720
Yeah, me too.

91
00:05:40,620 --> 00:05:42,897
Carmodyllomon, you really
need to control your temper.

92
00:05:42,980 --> 00:05:46,377
How in the Digi-World are we going
to find out where Oglemon is?

93
00:05:46,460 --> 00:05:47,578
Tentomon will help.

94
00:05:47,920 --> 00:05:51,397
Now that Tentomon is out of his tree, maybe
we can climb it and have a look around.

95
00:05:51,480 --> 00:05:52,310
You bet.

96
00:05:52,393 --> 00:05:53,223
And stay out of my tree.

97
00:05:53,960 --> 00:05:54,790
Oh.

98
00:05:55,220 --> 00:05:56,050
You okay?

99
00:05:57,160 --> 00:06:00,817
Tai hasn't been this angry since I
popped his soccer ball with my claws.

100
00:06:00,900 --> 00:06:02,277
He certainly has a right to be.

101
00:06:02,360 --> 00:06:05,220
All this standing around
is making my paws itch.

102
00:06:05,360 --> 00:06:07,100
Let's get going. Good idea.

103
00:06:07,420 --> 00:06:09,097
I'll go see what I can find out.

104
00:06:09,180 --> 00:06:10,940
And don't touch my tree.

105
00:06:11,260 --> 00:06:14,142
I know exactly how many
pieces of bark are on it.

106
00:06:14,260 --> 00:06:15,090
Hmm.

107
00:06:15,420 --> 00:06:17,920
Everything will be okay, Tai. I know.

108
00:06:19,020 --> 00:06:21,180
Greymon, the time has come.

109
00:06:23,120 --> 00:06:24,620
Greymon Dark Digimon!

110
00:06:27,280 --> 00:06:31,880
Greymon Dark Digimon to Skull 3!

111
00:06:32,740 --> 00:06:33,570
Aemon!

112
00:06:46,920 --> 00:06:51,449
Look, Master, he's trying to escape,
and we just had those walls re-stuckoed.

113
00:06:51,940 --> 00:06:52,770
Ah!

114
00:06:52,853 --> 00:06:53,683
He's too powerful!

115
00:06:53,766 --> 00:06:55,560
He's overloading the Dirk Ring!

116
00:06:55,860 --> 00:06:58,240
I must transfer more power to it!

117
00:07:13,420 --> 00:07:14,940
That was close

118
00:07:17,780 --> 00:07:21,700
You can't control Skull,
Greymon He's too powerful

119
00:07:22,880 --> 00:07:24,380
Oh yeah, wanna bet?

120
00:07:24,640 --> 00:07:29,480
Please, Master, let's just let him
go Be quiet Greymon, don't digivolve!

121
00:07:30,520 --> 00:07:33,020
Why won't he ever listen to me?

122
00:07:33,800 --> 00:07:35,420
Look, a control spire!

123
00:07:35,640 --> 00:07:38,737
This is one of the areas
controlled by the Digimon Emperor!

124
00:07:38,820 --> 00:07:39,938
Something's coming!

125
00:07:40,040 --> 00:07:41,216
Careful, Flamethron!

126
00:07:42,680 --> 00:07:44,100
I am Greymon!

127
00:07:44,320 --> 00:07:45,700
I cannot be defeated!

128
00:07:46,340 --> 00:07:47,170
Flameshield!

129
00:07:49,180 --> 00:07:51,140
Hey, I'm being defeated!

130
00:07:51,400 --> 00:07:52,230
Fire rocket!

131
00:07:52,313 --> 00:07:53,143
Yes!

132
00:07:57,280 --> 00:07:58,110
Yikes!

133
00:08:02,260 --> 00:08:04,436
What happened to me, and who are you?

134
00:08:04,680 --> 00:08:08,477
Hey, Woodmon, do you know where
the Digimon Emperor can be found?

135
00:08:08,560 --> 00:08:11,960
Well, I'm not really sure,
but I think he went that way.

136
00:08:12,920 --> 00:08:13,940
Thanks a bunch.

137
00:08:14,140 --> 00:08:15,100
Go, go!

138
00:08:15,940 --> 00:08:18,180
Wait, can I get a little help here?

139
00:08:19,740 --> 00:08:21,034
Seriously, pinch fire!

140
00:08:21,460 --> 00:08:22,320
Really heavy!

141
00:08:24,180 --> 00:08:27,180
Huh, I cleaned my glasses
for the third time today.

142
00:08:27,400 --> 00:08:29,820
And I'm still not happy. Weird.

143
00:08:30,140 --> 00:08:32,300
Tai, guys, is everything okay?

144
00:08:32,840 --> 00:08:37,660
Oh, they probably don't want to talk
to me anymore after I let them down.

145
00:08:38,340 --> 00:08:40,220
Well, it's time I got tough.

146
00:08:41,040 --> 00:08:42,360
Oops, I missed a spot.

147
00:08:42,560 --> 00:08:46,177
According to my information,
Agumon can be found in Rail Town.

148
00:08:46,260 --> 00:08:47,620
That's great, Tentomon.

149
00:08:47,720 --> 00:08:48,637
I'll let them know.

150
00:08:48,720 --> 00:08:50,877
And tell them to stay out of my tree.

151
00:08:50,960 --> 00:08:52,220
Uh, you bet.

152
00:08:53,320 --> 00:08:55,200
Is everybody okay, Izzy?

153
00:08:55,400 --> 00:08:57,037
Tentomon may have found Agumon.

154
00:08:57,120 --> 00:08:58,097
Hey, what's wrong?

155
00:08:58,180 --> 00:08:59,010
I want to help.

156
00:08:59,093 --> 00:09:00,845
Please let me tell them, okay?

157
00:09:02,100 --> 00:09:04,177
Sure, just tell them about Rail Town.

158
00:09:04,260 --> 00:09:05,090
Yeah.

159
00:09:07,200 --> 00:09:08,160
Once more...

160
00:09:09,880 --> 00:09:11,220
The power levels.

161
00:09:12,920 --> 00:09:13,750
Hmm.

162
00:09:21,340 --> 00:09:25,617
foolish creature you should
know better than to fight me

163
00:09:25,700 --> 00:09:30,057
but you've given me what i
need the dark ring can control

164
00:09:30,140 --> 00:09:34,537
an adult stage digimon but
not a fully evolved digimon

165
00:09:34,620 --> 00:09:37,800
it needs to be a different
shape like a cylinder or a

166
00:09:39,100 --> 00:09:42,000
Of course I know what I need to do now.

167
00:09:44,240 --> 00:09:45,880
Tai, slow down.

168
00:09:46,180 --> 00:09:48,298
We don't have the time to slow down.

169
00:09:48,660 --> 00:09:52,960
Oh, hey, look. We've made it.
Rail town. Rail town. Rail town.

170
00:09:53,160 --> 00:09:55,631
Looks more like grass and hill town to me.

171
00:09:56,040 --> 00:09:56,870
Come on, guys.

172
00:09:56,953 --> 00:09:59,566
Agumon is in this town
somewhere, so let's go.

173
00:10:00,060 --> 00:10:02,707
Everybody split up and
start looking for him.

174
00:10:21,080 --> 00:10:23,620
If Agumon escapes, Ken
will have to use me.

175
00:10:23,820 --> 00:10:25,291
But he's going to be mad.

176
00:10:28,940 --> 00:10:30,587
I'll bake him some brownies.

177
00:10:34,280 --> 00:10:36,340
The dark ring's gone. I'm free.

178
00:10:36,980 --> 00:10:39,140
Now it's time for a little payback.

179
00:10:39,420 --> 00:10:42,780
This new structure will
increase the power tenfold.

180
00:10:44,220 --> 00:10:46,520
I won't even need the control spires.

181
00:10:47,840 --> 00:10:52,240
No one will ever be able to stop me
from taking over the digital world.

182
00:10:52,580 --> 00:10:55,800
Not a dark ring, but a dark spiral.

183
00:10:56,500 --> 00:11:00,120
With this, I can control even
a fully digivolved Digimon.

184
00:11:00,580 --> 00:11:02,300
Now to test it on Agumon.

185
00:11:03,640 --> 00:11:04,840
What? He's gone!

186
00:11:05,780 --> 00:11:06,610
But...

187
00:11:06,693 --> 00:11:07,523
but how?

188
00:11:08,040 --> 00:11:09,920
Tai, Agumon's close.

189
00:11:10,200 --> 00:11:11,437
I'm following his tracks.

190
00:11:11,520 --> 00:11:13,285
Those are train tracks, Davis.

191
00:11:14,180 --> 00:11:16,020
What's that noise? Huh?

192
00:11:17,500 --> 00:11:19,680
It's either the local or the express.

193
00:11:20,660 --> 00:11:22,013
And look who's driving.

194
00:11:23,800 --> 00:11:24,630
Whoa!

195
00:11:26,840 --> 00:11:27,670
It's...

196
00:11:27,753 --> 00:11:29,980
it's Agumon. Agumon! Tai!

197
00:11:32,460 --> 00:11:34,200
That ought to slow him down.

198
00:11:38,660 --> 00:11:40,100
Agumon, are you okay?

199
00:11:40,640 --> 00:11:41,980
I'm fine, Tai!

200
00:11:43,800 --> 00:11:45,480
I'm so happy to see you.

201
00:11:45,640 --> 00:11:47,560
Give me a great big hug. Ouch!

202
00:11:48,100 --> 00:11:49,980
Are you okay? Did he hurt you?

203
00:11:50,260 --> 00:11:52,557
No, you were just
squeezing my ribs too hard.

204
00:11:52,640 --> 00:11:54,052
Tai, we should get going.

205
00:11:55,180 --> 00:11:57,600
I'm sure Ken will come after Agumon.

206
00:11:58,060 --> 00:11:59,040
Are you kidding?

207
00:11:59,340 --> 00:12:00,869
We all came here to fight!

208
00:12:01,180 --> 00:12:03,117
Now you want us to turn
around and go home?

209
00:12:03,200 --> 00:12:06,297
Listen, I want to get back at the
guy who did this to Agumon, too,

210
00:12:06,380 --> 00:12:07,517
but you gotta learn, Davis,

211
00:12:07,600 --> 00:12:10,057
that sometimes you gotta think with
your head and not with your heart.

212
00:12:10,140 --> 00:12:12,316
Remember, we're not at full strength.

213
00:12:12,480 --> 00:12:17,421
And Agumon's been through a lot, so our
first priority is to get him back to safety.

214
00:12:17,600 --> 00:12:20,017
You mean we can come back
here later and get him?

215
00:12:20,100 --> 00:12:20,930
Mm-hmm.

216
00:12:22,360 --> 00:12:23,960
How did Agumon get away?

217
00:12:24,200 --> 00:12:26,017
An escape clause in his contract?

218
00:12:26,100 --> 00:12:27,571
I'm in no mood for humor.

219
00:12:27,800 --> 00:12:31,077
Good, because I want to talk
to you about something serious.

220
00:12:31,160 --> 00:12:31,990
Master?

221
00:12:32,120 --> 00:12:32,950
What?

222
00:12:33,200 --> 00:12:36,906
I was just thinking that you
could use me for your experiments.

223
00:12:37,100 --> 00:12:39,620
I mean, I am a Digimon just like Agumon.

224
00:12:39,740 --> 00:12:41,180
I can Digivolve, too.

225
00:12:41,540 --> 00:12:42,481
What do you say?

226
00:12:43,140 --> 00:12:46,140
I say you can forget
about it! But, Master,

227
00:12:46,360 --> 00:12:50,137
please, I've done absolutely everything
around here you've asked me to do and more.

228
00:12:50,220 --> 00:12:53,161
I even cleaned that hair
trap thing in the shower.

229
00:12:53,380 --> 00:12:54,210
Don't laugh.

230
00:12:54,640 --> 00:12:57,517
And what kind of Digimon
would you Digivolve into, huh?

231
00:12:57,600 --> 00:13:01,497
Perhaps you'd transform yourself into a
giant butterfly with scary-looking wings?

232
00:13:01,580 --> 00:13:02,410
Heh,

233
00:13:02,493 --> 00:13:04,277
you're about as useless
to me as an old pair of

234
00:13:04,360 --> 00:13:07,160
underwear that's made
out of 100 % poison ivy.

235
00:13:11,560 --> 00:13:13,700
And will you stop calling me Ken?

236
00:13:13,820 --> 00:13:15,644
My name is the Digimon Emperor!

237
00:13:16,100 --> 00:13:20,041
All I'm saying is, now that Agumon
has escaped, I'm all you've got.

238
00:13:23,220 --> 00:13:24,217
Enough! Huh?

239
00:13:24,300 --> 00:13:25,260
They're here.

240
00:13:25,700 --> 00:13:27,740
And they've got Agumon.

241
00:13:29,820 --> 00:13:31,600
He's a useful Digimon.

242
00:13:32,040 --> 00:13:33,740
But, Ken, I am...

243
00:13:34,940 --> 00:13:37,057
And we'll have cookies and ice cream.

244
00:13:37,140 --> 00:13:39,157
I want mine with chocolate sprinkles.

245
00:13:39,240 --> 00:13:40,440
How endearing.

246
00:13:41,820 --> 00:13:42,650
It's Ken.

247
00:13:42,920 --> 00:13:45,240
My name is the Digimon Emperor.

248
00:13:45,600 --> 00:13:47,717
So now you don't want
to be called Ken, huh?

249
00:13:47,800 --> 00:13:48,630
All right, then.

250
00:13:48,713 --> 00:13:49,697
How's Kenny or Kenny?

251
00:13:49,780 --> 00:13:52,074
You really don't want to make me angry.

252
00:13:52,320 --> 00:13:55,937
So you're the one who put Agumon
in a cage like a wild animal.

253
00:13:56,020 --> 00:13:59,357
You come down here now and
take your medicine like a man.

254
00:13:59,440 --> 00:14:00,720
You do amuse me so.

255
00:14:00,940 --> 00:14:03,960
I can defeat you just as
I defeated Agumon. Try it.

256
00:14:04,140 --> 00:14:06,177
You should be ashamed of yourself, Ken.

257
00:14:06,260 --> 00:14:09,660
You're the kind of bully that
gives bullies a bad name.

258
00:14:11,520 --> 00:14:15,461
