265
00:14:41,220 --> 00:14:42,050
Digimon!

266
00:14:42,133 --> 00:14:42,963
Digital monsters!

267
00:14:43,046 --> 00:14:43,876
Digimon!

268
00:14:59,260 --> 00:15:02,600
Don't let Fladramon have
all the fun, Cody. Right!

269
00:15:03,440 --> 00:15:06,020
Digi-Armor Energize!

270
00:15:09,100 --> 00:15:12,020
Armagillomon, Armored Digivolve to...

