275
00:15:35,520 --> 00:15:37,160
They're winning!

276
00:15:37,560 --> 00:15:38,780
Fire Rocket!

277
00:15:43,500 --> 00:15:45,500
He's tough, I'll save.

278
00:15:46,720 --> 00:15:48,980
Digi-Armor Energize!

279
00:15:51,640 --> 00:15:52,470
Digimon.

280
00:15:52,553 --> 00:15:55,780
Gatomon, Armored Digimon, to...

281
00:15:59,240 --> 00:16:02,660
Digimon, Digital Monsters,
Digimon are the champions!

282
00:16:04,780 --> 00:16:07,057
Nefertimon, the Angel of Light!

283
00:16:07,140 --> 00:16:08,500
Digimon! Digimon!

284
00:16:08,720 --> 00:16:10,240
Ademon, armor, Digimon!

285
00:16:15,120 --> 00:16:16,317
Digimon! Digimon!

286
00:16:16,400 --> 00:16:17,400
Digimon monsters!

287
00:16:17,540 --> 00:16:19,069
Digimon are the champions!

288
00:16:21,160 --> 00:16:25,660
Pegasmon flying home!
Digimon! Rosetta! Go!

289
00:16:27,000 --> 00:16:27,920
Windmane!

290
00:16:29,300 --> 00:16:30,220
Equispied!

291
00:16:35,140 --> 00:16:35,970
