296
00:16:50,160 --> 00:16:51,780
You are mine again.

297
00:16:53,860 --> 00:16:55,880
Agumon, are you okay? Look out!

298
00:16:57,420 --> 00:16:59,360
He's being controlled again.

299
00:17:00,620 --> 00:17:02,360
Now, Agumon, dark Digivolve!

300
00:17:05,400 --> 00:17:07,060
Agumon, talk Digibomb!

301
00:17:10,440 --> 00:17:11,720
Metal Greymon!

302
00:17:12,520 --> 00:17:15,380
He looks so different. And mean.

303
00:17:16,240 --> 00:17:19,297
Metal Greymon's armor not
only protects him from harm,

304
00:17:19,380 --> 00:17:22,380
but it conceals his
destructive Gigablaster attack.

305
00:17:22,800 --> 00:17:25,220
The Dark Spiral is working perfectly.

306
00:17:25,400 --> 00:17:26,700
Agumon is mine again!

307
00:17:27,080 --> 00:17:30,357
Metal Greymon, you've got to fight
the Digimon Emperor's control.

308
00:17:30,440 --> 00:17:31,300
