313
00:17:39,420 --> 00:17:40,820
Metal Greymon, attack!

314
00:17:41,860 --> 00:17:42,700
Look out!

315
00:17:43,740 --> 00:17:45,681
Die, he doesn't know who you are!

316
00:17:46,120 --> 00:17:48,532
