317
00:17:50,000 --> 00:17:50,960
Golden Noose!

318
00:17:55,380 --> 00:17:56,262
Don't hurt him!

319
00:17:56,460 --> 00:17:58,060
He's Metal, he'll be fine.

320
00:17:58,260 --> 00:17:59,960
Hey, what? Hold it!

321
00:18:00,120 --> 00:18:01,414
