to the Digimon Emperor.

373
00:20:30,240 --> 00:20:31,070
You're right.

374
00:20:31,160 --> 00:20:33,677
In the future, when we
battle the Digimon Emperor,

375
00:20:33,760 --> 00:20:36,897
we have to be prepared to face
our friend Agumon as well.

376
00:20:36,980 --> 00:20:39,333
So, I don't really know how to say this.

377
00:20:39,440 --> 00:20:40,840
Let me handle this, Tai.

378
00:20:41,220 --> 00:20:45,000
Everyone, the next time you see
Agumon, trash him, understand?

379
00:20:45,160 --> 00:20:46,480
I can't hear you!

380
00:20:47,020 --> 00:20:47,850
Okay!

381
00:20:48,340 --> 00:20:49,300
Defeat Agumon!

382
00:20:49,600 --> 00:20:51,937
I can't believe those words
actually came out of my mouth!

383
00:20:52,020 --> 00:20:54,620
Yeah, let's all go get Agumon back.

384
00:20:55,600 --> 00:20:58,424
