important people travel.

386
00:21:01,740 --> 00:21:02,570
Cute.

387
00:21:03,580 --> 00:21:05,040
I can't see a thing.

388
00:21:05,280 --> 00:21:07,633
Who put the sail in front of everything?

389
00:21:22,020 --> 00:21:22,937
This is not the case.

390
00:21:26,020 --> 00:21:28,700
Look at it. It's not the case.

391
00:21:28,820 --> 00:21:30,460
Just give it a hint.

392
00:21:31,720 --> 00:21:33,180
I can't feel it.

393
00:21:34,200 --> 00:21:35,560
I can't feel it.

394
00:21:36,680 --> 00:21:38,377
It's not the case.

395
00:21:38,460 --> 00:21:40,480
It's almost like a sound.

396
00:21:41,240 --> 00:21:44,240
The feeling is good.

397
00:21:45,200 --> 00:21:49,137
I'm so sorry.

398
00:21:49,220 --> 00:21:51,717
Thank

399
00:21:51,800 --> 00:21:58,800
you

400
00:21:59,880 --> 00:22:06,880
very

401
00:22:18,860 --> 00:22:19,690
much.

402
00:22:49,385 --> 00:22:52,380
That's why the new Digimental is called
the V-MON, and the 2nd of the armor.

403
00:22:52,860 --> 00:22:57,840
In the next episode of Digimon
